+# Keep the repository, and above all the CSV fixtures the tests compare byte for
+# byte, on LF in every working tree. Without this a default Windows clone
+# (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites tests/*.csv to CRLF and reddens the node suite
+# on line endings alone.
+* text=auto eol=lf
+
+*.png binary
+*.jpg binary
+*.gif binary
+*.ico binary
